(text "Miata ECU daughterboard rev 0.8 (on-board wideband controller, flashed through the main MCU; 5 V low-side drive, fused logic supply). Block sheets connect through global labels; GND, +3V3, +5V and +12V are power symbols. J1 = power in and outputs (top edge), J2 = inputs and comms (bottom edge). 4-layer board: In1 GND plane, In2 +3V3 plane." (at 30.48 165.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 156d29da-33aa-4244-9af6-f950e234f2fb)) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))